v“What is Auth Guard in Angular?”
✅ Best Answer:

Auth Guard is used to protect routes in Angular applications.
It checks authentication or authorization logic before a route is activated and either allows access or redirects the user.

When to use Auth Guard?

Protect dashboard

Protect admin pages

Protect user profile

Protect feature pages like Leads, Contacts, Tasks

Auth Guard = Gatekeeper of routes

